---
name: skill-check
description: Cursor stand-in for the skill-forced-eval hook. Before acting on any request, check the available skills; if one matches, read and follow its SKILL.md before doing anything else.
alwaysApply: true
metadata:
  version: "1.0.1"
---

Before acting on a request, check the skills available in this project (the
`SKILL.md` files under `.cursor/skills/`, `.agents/skills/`, `.claude/skills/`
and your personal skills). If a skill's description matches the request, including indirect
phrasing such as the examples quoted in its description, read its `SKILL.md`
and follow it before using any other tool. If no skill matches, proceed
without one and do not invent a skill name.
